# Angular Application with Four Components — Viva Questions

---

# BASIC ANGULAR QUESTIONS

## 1. What is Angular?

Angular is a frontend framework used to build Single Page Applications (SPA).

Developed by [Google Angular](https://angular.dev?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

---

## 2. What is SPA?

SPA means Single Page Application.

Only one page loads and content changes dynamically.

---

## 3. What language does Angular use?

TypeScript.

---

## 4. What is TypeScript?

TypeScript is a superset of JavaScript.

Adds:

* Types
* Classes
* Interfaces

---

## 5. What is Angular CLI?

CLI = Command Line Interface.

Used to:

* Create project
* Create components
* Run application

---

## 6. Command to install Angular CLI?

```bash
npm install -g @angular/cli
```

---

## 7. Command to create Angular project?

```bash
ng new myapp
```

---

## 8. Command to run Angular project?

```bash
ng serve
```

---

## 9. Default Angular port?

```text
4200
```

---

## 10. Command to create component?

```bash
ng generate component home
```

Shortcut:

```bash
ng g c home
```

---

# COMPONENT QUESTIONS

## 11. What is Component?

A reusable UI block in Angular.

Example:

* Header
* Footer
* Login form

---

## 12. What files are created with component?

Example:

```text
home.component.ts
home.component.html
home.component.css
home.component.spec.ts
```

---

## 13. Purpose of `.ts` file?

Contains logic.

---

## 14. Purpose of `.html` file?

Contains UI.

---

## 15. Purpose of `.css` file?

Styling.

---

## 16. Purpose of `.spec.ts` file?

Testing.

---

## 17. What is selector?

Custom HTML tag for component.

Example:

```typescript
selector: 'app-home'
```

Used as:

```html
<app-home></app-home>
```

---

## 18. What is root component?

Main component of Angular app.

Usually:

```text
AppComponent
```

---

## 19. Which file loads first in Angular?

```text
main.ts
```

---

## 20. What is bootstrap in Angular?

Starting component of application.

Example:

```typescript
bootstrapApplication(App)
```

---

# FILE STRUCTURE QUESTIONS

## 21. Important folders in Angular?

| Folder       | Purpose            |
| ------------ | ------------------ |
| src          | Source code        |
| app          | Components         |
| assets       | Images/files       |
| node_modules | Installed packages |

---

## 22. What is `package.json`?

Contains:

* dependencies
* scripts
* project information

---

## 23. What is `angular.json`?

Angular configuration file.

---

## 24. What is `node_modules`?

Stores installed npm packages.

---

# DATA BINDING QUESTIONS

## 25. What is Data Binding?

Connecting HTML and TypeScript data.

---

## 26. Types of Data Binding?

1. Interpolation
2. Property Binding
3. Event Binding
4. Two-way Binding

---

## 27. Example of Interpolation?

```html
{{title}}
```

---

## 28. Example of Property Binding?

```html
<img [src]="image">
```

---

## 29. Example of Event Binding?

```html
<button (click)="show()">
```

---

## 30. Example of Two-way Binding?

```html
[(ngModel)]
```

---

# DIRECTIVE QUESTIONS

## 31. What is Directive?

Instructions for DOM manipulation.

---

## 32. Types of Directives?

1. Component Directive
2. Structural Directive
3. Attribute Directive

---

## 33. What is `*ngIf`?

Conditional display.

Example:

```html
<p *ngIf="true">Hello</p>
```

---

## 34. What is `*ngFor`?

Loop directive.

Example:

```html
<li *ngFor="let x of items">
```

---

# ROUTING QUESTIONS

## 35. What is Routing?

Navigation between components/pages.

---

## 36. Command to add routing?

```bash
ng new myapp --routing
```

---

## 37. Which file contains routes?

```text
app.routes.ts
```

OR

```text
app-routing.module.ts
```

---

